    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis property is in fabulous condition and will make a fantastic home for those looking for a family or holiday home that is close to a vibrant village with amenities that include National School, pub, GAA Club, Spar shop, church, restaurant and easy access to fabulous beaches.\nIt sits on an elevated site which provides it with great privacy and fabulous country views.\nAccommodation downstairs includes a large bright open plan living area, incorporating a well equipped kitchen, generous dining space a good sized sunroom and a utility room. There is also a seperate livingroom, double bedroom and good sized bathroom.\nUpstairs includes two ensuite bedrooms, one being the master which incorporates generous storage, a large ensuite and a feature panoranic window.\nThe half acre site is easly managed and benefits from a good sized detached garage and a raised decking area which is to the side of the property and can be easily accessed from the kitchen.\nAll in all a great easily managed home, close to great neighbours, a pretty village and some great beaches."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 6.03m x 2.05m\nWith tiled flooring and under stairs storage.\n\nOpen Plan Living-Kitchen-Sunroom - \n\n\nKitchen - Dining Area - 8.08m x 3.45m\nBright and spacious with dual aspect, double doors to a raised patio area, waist and eye level storage, tiled flooring and splashbacks and open access into the sunroom.\n\nSun Room - 3.7m x 3.36m\nFantastic extra living space with tiled flooring and fabulous panoramic countryside views.\n\nUtility Room - 2.22m x 1.71m\nWith waist and eye level storage, plumbing for a washing machine and tiled flooring and splashbacks.\n\nLiving Room - 4.23m x 4.21m\nGood size for entertaining with inserted stove.\n\nBathroom - 2.23m x 2.10m\nFully tiled with w.c. w.h.b and bath.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.75m x 3m\nGreat addition for any home.\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding - 1.86m x 1.86m\nSpace for a \"work station\".\n\nBedroom 2 Ensuite - 5.31m x 2.45m\nWith fitted storage.\n\nEnsuite - 2.85m x 1.08m\nTiled with Triton T90 Electric Shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 3 Ensuite - 6.44m x 4.57m\nHuge room , dual aspect with feature window to the rear that enjoys terrific views.\n\nEnsuite - \nWith tiled flooring and part tiled walls, w.c. w.h.b. and electric shower.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nDetached Garage - 5.51m x 3.58m\nRoom for the boat or simply \"a man cave\". Big bonus.\n\n"
      },
